_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQES5WhxC4e2edu0mRh1geIalcoAJ8-m2A0Nd7H-2fhBQw&oe=6A8301A4"}, {"file_name": "SkyRiders_Screens_legendkit_04.png", "id": "2001380330583410", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620860_2001380333916743_2653996373056212862_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AGwldIMTpt8Q7kNvwFUVEkw&_nc_oc=AdrjHu8EULSVNKEhPfUF_O6UdgKPLDDjKWx0cMFTzCZin54m70Zq13LDgwSsGkXGxgE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGbrPMAE4WqGtFOQKyCm7W7LHScOme0vp_V6zusAR3TPw&oe=6A82F1D1"}, {"file_name": "SkyRiders_20260701_Screen10.png", "id": "1710980126763152", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307931_1710980130096485_7985990031544113354_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1u6AKsoMO9YQ7kNvwFIShoh&_nc_oc=AdqY50HWIIx4vRIE3QaWvQNTTaAQFPHYmVcnwtdGcwH1_k4Ao056DHYH_ZJudxgT55o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFfiTT7kfun14sv2D2s1iHrxD2ec0yTswq9WgZwh-69rw&oe=6A830414"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "SkyRiders_Landscape (3).png", "id": "2418563821999037", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314623_2418563825332370_3093547181484454894_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B1wYTyyM5EUQ7kNvwGVFoH-&_nc_oc=AdoZan6tbqz-1tRvAnd06UhuoixkSW590-1MLV-qAAlMT76GPb4xA66oWSHGMoslAFA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFVB0YtiBzQistBxSM49KNWG6I4CAb8gpVZQ9jyqhLCuw&oe=6A8308A5"}, "display_name": "Sky Riders", "keywords": ["medieval", "dragon", "fly", "fight"], "long_description": "                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                     \n                                                                                                                                                                                        \n{4393695077560579}\n# \ud83d\uddff MEET THE NEW DARK GARGOYLE!\n\nA **fearsome new Sky Legend has arrived!** Unlock the **Dark Gargoyle**, master its unique powers, and add a legendary new ally to your collection. Level it up, unleash its strength, and take on the biggest bosses in Sky Riders.\n\n{1041878808514112}\n\n# \ud83d\udd25 RAISE YOUR CREATURES. UNLEASH THE CHAOS.\n\nRaise legendary **Dragons**, **Griffins**, *Dark Gargoyles**\u2014each infused with the power of fire \ud83d\udd25 and thunder \u26a1. \n\nEvolve your Sky Legends, unleash powerful abilities, and battle across land and sky.\n\n{1333925848679269}\n\n**\ud83d\udd25 GROW YOUR CREATURES**\n\n\u2022 **Unlock and evolve**powerful sky creatures\n\n\u2022 **Level up** through combat and increase your power\n\n\u2022 **Rise from ground** battles to full sky domination\n\n{1348221020611498} \n\n**\u2694\ufe0f FAST PACED ACTION**\n\n\u2022 Jump into quick, **high-energy fights** anytime\n\n\u2022 **Battle** across land and sky\n\n{1348221020611498} \n \n**\ud83c\udf0d EXPLORE & CONQUER**\n\n\u2022 **Discover** prairies, caves, mountains, and sky zones\n\n\u2022 New areas **unlock** as you grow stronger\n\n{1336539598438564}\n\n**\u26a1 FIRE & THUNDER POWERS**\n\n\u2022 **Wield creatures** infused with elemental power \ud83d\udd25\u26a1\n\n\u2022 Master **different abilities** and combat styles\n\n\u2022 **Find your ultimate way to dominate**\n\n{1048551570830628}\n\n**\ud83e\udd1d MASSIVE CO-OP BOSSES**\n\n\u2022 Enter **epic battles** through world portals\n\n\u2022 Take down **colossal enemies** with your team\n\n\u2022 **Chaotic fights** with high-value rewards\n\n\n{1548591023512558}\n\n**\ud83d\udc8e LOOT & POWER UP**\n\n\u2022 **Earn XP** to evolve your creatures\n\n\u2022 **Collect gems** to **upgrade** your weapons and creatures\n\n\n**\u26a1 GROW STRONGER. FLY HIGHER. HIT HARDER.**\n\n**Your Sky Legends. Your adventure. Your victory.**\n\n\ud83d\udd17 Join the community: **https://discord.com/invite/etermaxrstudio**\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "\ud83d\uddff Meet the new Dark Gargoyle! Raise and evolve legendary Dragons, Griffins, and Gargoyles infused with fire and thunder \ud83d\udd25\u26a1 Dive into chaotic battles across land and sky \ud83c\udf0d\u2601\ufe0f, unleash powerful abilities, gear up \u2694\ufe0f, and team up \ud83e\udd1d to defeat massive bosses \ud83d\udc09"}]}, "developer_name": "etermax XR Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.etermax.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.etermax.com/terms/", "publisher_name": "Etermax XR Studios", "support_website_url": "https://www.etermax.com/support", "website_url": "https://www.etermax.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ADVENTURE", "FLYING"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "26987915514216556"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499313072_1371138571051268_6798627775359298335_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SiLvOpBWwZYQ7kNvwGR5eFa&_nc_oc=Adqd2QXoy2GIbURH0aq5fWPx9KjO-Cj9EhxzM9kaZ9WGkCc-gG4_-Z9Qf0dNyFlVeM4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH9Auw635MhddP8f5rxf8_b9ztrCnh